### Registro
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Roman",
  "email": "roman@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "roman@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Listar vehículos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwiZW1haWwiOiJyb21hbkB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc5NDU4MDI4MCwiZXhwIjoxNzk0NTk0NjgwfQ.okApqURimnh7jQdE5SXgUB5U_SxVz0gGV7Z1GJy1l60

### Crear vehículo
POST http://localhost:3000/api/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwiZW1haWwiOiJyb21hbkB0ZXN0LmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc5NDU4MDI4MCwiZXhwIjoxNzk0NTk0NjgwfQ.okApqURimnh7jQdE5SXgUB5U_SxVz0gGV7Z1GJy1l60
